ttps://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/nonaveragejoe\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2Mjk2MDE2LmpwZw==/25x25%23/V2dFaQ.jpg)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/nonaveragejoe\">NonAverageJoe</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-06-28 19:34:28\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16422010\">66 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"upvotes\">(+1)</span></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>I do, &nbsp;but I\u2019m going to wait until I get the deposit I needed to put down for Twilight of Bronze back, then I\u2019ll use it to release Gekokujo, when its more polished.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post has_replies has_vote_column\" id=\"post-16278924\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:6137612,&quot;id&quot;:16278924}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/deadreckoner\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog-red.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/deadreckoner\">deadreckoner</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-06-12 19:08:42\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16278924\">82 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"upvotes\">(+1)</span></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>This looks like a really exciting and ambitious project, but it&#x27;s a little hard to get a feel for the gameplay due to some immediate obstacles like:</p><ul><li>The &quot;?&quot; key rapidly toggles the control list rather than popping it up once and then waiting for another input to close it. (It also doesn&#x27;t actually list the controls, but someone else has pointed that out already.)</li><li>The tutorial begins by instructing you to travel to a town but doesn&#x27;t specify what the town looks like, how to find it, or how to enter it once you&#x27;re there.</li><li>Many of the UI elements are abbreviated with no way to expand them or understand what they mean.</li></ul><p>Looking forward to how this game develops as you work on it further! I&nbsp;think given the popularity of the Gekokujo and Shokuho mods for Mount &amp; Blade, there&#x27;s obviously a lot of interest in adventure sims in this setting.</p><p>For reference, I&#x27;m using the Windows build on a Windows 11 device.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post_replies top_level_replies\"><div class=\"community_post is_reply has_vote_column\" id=\"post-16280045\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:1642176,&quot;id&quot;:16280045}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/nonaveragejoe\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2Mjk2MDE2LmpwZw==/25x25%23/V2dFaQ.jpg)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/nonaveragejoe\">NonAverageJoe</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-06-12 23:27:53\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16280045\">82 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>Thank you for your reply! I believe I fixed the ? help, It\u2019ll be out in the next release, the tutorial is very confusing and I apologize, you spawn on the first settlement it tells you to \u201cgo to\u201d, but afterwards when it tells you to go to a settlement nearby, I need to make it tell you to look by pressing escape and selecting \u201cFind City\u201d or just give you the pathway to it.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post has_replies has_vote_column\" id=\"post-16267343\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:436883,&quot;id&quot;:16267343}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnonaveragejoe.itch.io%2Fgekokujo-jidai\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/trazen4\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog-gold.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/trazen4\">Trazen4</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-06-10 17:33:06\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16267343\">84 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"